# 2.宽转长（把多列合并为单列中的多类）
relig_income #宗教信仰与收入调查
relig_income |> pivot_longer(cols = where(is.numeric), 
                              names_to = '收入范围', values_to = '数值')

billboard #2000年歌曲排行前100名
billboard |> pivot_longer(cols = num_range('wk',1:76), 
                           names_to = '周', 
                           values_to = '值', 
                           names_prefix = 'wk',
                           values_drop_na = T, 
                           names_transform = as.integer)
who #世界卫生组织结核病数据
who |> pivot_longer(
  cols = -c(1:4),
  names_to = c("diagnosis", "gender", "age"),
  names_pattern = "new_?(.*)_(.)(.*)", #在列名中提取多个模式信息，存在new后没有下滑线的情况
  values_to = "count"
) |> View()

# 单列分割----
df <- tibble(id = 1:3, x = c("m-123", "f-455", "f-123"))
df  

df |> separate_wider_delim(x, delim = "-", names = c("gender", "unit")) #按分隔符
df |> separate_wider_position(x, c(gender = 1, 1, unit = 3)) #按位置，未命名的直接舍去
df |> separate_wider_regex(x, c(gender = ".", ".", unit = "\\d+")) #按正则表达式

df <- tibble(var = c("race_1", "race_2", "age_bucket_1", "age_bucket_2"))
df  

df |> separate_wider_delim(var, "_", names = c("var1", "var2"), too_many = "merge")#多出的合并
df |> separate_wider_delim(var, "_", names = c("var1", "var2"), too_many = "drop") #多出的丢弃
df |> separate_wider_regex(var,  patterns = c(var1 = ".*?","_",var2 = "\\d*")) 
#".*?"表示从当前位置开始，尝试匹配最短的字符串，直到满足后续的正则表达式（这里是"\\d*"）

